{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.965,"lines":[{"text":"Le café est froid, la lumière décline","t":12.4,"e":16.54,"w":[["Le",12.4,12.48],["café",12.56,13.08],["est",13.12,13.26],["froid",13.38,13.74],["la",14.98,15.08],["lumière",15.14,15.7],["décline",15.76,16.54]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je porte sur le dos leurs peines, leurs racines","t":17.56,"e":21.52,"w":[["Je",17.56,17.66],["porte",17.78,18.04],["sur",18.12,18.28],["le",18.34,18.46],["dos",18.6,18.98],["leurs",19.4,19.64],["peines",19.76,20.2],["leurs",20.42,20.82],["racines",20.9,21.52]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Un mari qui attend, un enfant qui appelle","t":22.8,"e":27.4,"w":[["Un",22.8,22.9],["mari",23.02,23.38],["qui",23.44,23.54],["attend",23.6,24],["un",25.34,25.5],["enfant",25.56,26],["qui",26.08,26.2],["appelle",26.3,27.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Et je souris encore pour que la vie soit belle.","t":28.24,"e":33.76,"w":[["Et",28.24,28.38],["je",28.44,28.56],["souris",28.68,29.52],["encore",29.62,30.52],["pour",30.62,30.76],["que",30.82,30.98],["la",31.06,31.24],["vie",31.3,31.94],["soit",32.06,32.54],["belle",32.82,33.76]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"I just need to breathe, make I find small space","t":34.64,"e":39.2,"w":[["I",34.64,34.72],["just",34.94,35.36],["need",35.44,35.64],["to",35.72,35.98],["breathe",36.06,36.5],["make",37.2,37.52],["I",37.64,37.9],["find",38.02,38.22],["small",38.28,38.56],["space",38.62,39.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Place wey nobody go look my face.","t":39.3,"e":41.72,"w":[["Place",39.3,39.6],["wey",39.64,39.74],["nobody",39.82,40.4],["go",40.44,40.56],["look",40.62,40.88],["my",40.96,41.2],["face",41.28,41.72]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"To just dey on my own, no give, no pay","t":41.76,"e":44.35,"w":[["To",41.76,41.86],["just",41.94,42.2],["dey",42.33,42.53],["on",42.46,42.66],["my",42.74,42.88],["own",42.92,43.02],["no",43.06,43.18],["give",43.24,43.46],["no",43.54,43.76],["pay",44.15,44.35]],"ok":0.8},{"text":"Make this world clock stop, just for today.","t":44.54,"e":48.7,"w":[["Make",44.54,44.74],["this",45.02,45.28],["world",45.36,45.76],["clock",45.84,46.34],["stop",46.44,46.78],["just",47.64,47.86],["for",47.94,48.18],["today",48.26,48.7]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Small time for myself, for inside the night","t":48.88,"e":51.42,"w":[["Small",48.88,49.18],["time",49.24,49.38],["for",49.44,49.54],["myself",49.6,50.1],["for",50.14,50.26],["inside",50.32,50.86],["the",50.88,50.96],["night",51.04,51.42]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"So I no go loss, as I dey carry their fight.","t":51.54,"e":54.1,"w":[["So",51.54,51.82],["I",51.92,51.96],["no",52.02,52.14],["go",52.18,52.3],["loss",52.36,52.66],["as",52.74,52.84],["I",52.92,52.96],["dey",53,53.1],["carry",53.16,53.44],["their",53.48,53.68],["fight",53.76,54.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"My brother dey lean, my mama dey fear","t":54.18,"e":56.78,"w":[["My",54.18,54.36],["brother",54.42,54.8],["dey",54.86,55.02],["lean",55.12,55.4],["my",55.52,55.68],["mama",55.76,56.08],["dey",56.12,56.24],["fear",56.4,56.78]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"I keep all my cry, I no let them hear.","t":56.86,"e":59.32,"w":[["I",56.86,56.92],["keep",57,57.22],["all",57.24,57.36],["my",57.44,57.62],["cry",57.7,58.06],["I",58.16,58.24],["no",58.3,58.42],["let",58.5,58.68],["them",58.74,58.92],["hear",58.98,59.32]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dem say \"you strong o\", dem say \"you be rock\"","t":59.48,"e":61.7,"w":[["Dem",59.48,59.68],["say",59.64,59.8],["you",59.86,59.94],["strong",60.04,60.38],["o",60.42,60.54],["dem",60.71,60.91],["say",60.88,61],["you",61.06,61.12],["be",61.18,61.28],["rock",61.38,61.7]],"ok":0.8},{"text":"But rock self dey crack, if the load too much.","t":61.98,"e":64.34,"w":[["But",61.98,62.08],["rock",62.16,62.32],["self",62.4,62.58],["dey",62.62,62.74],["crack",62.84,63.14],["if",63.2,63.28],["the",63.32,63.42],["load",63.5,63.7],["too",63.76,63.9],["much",63.98,64.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"I wan be like shadow, like breeze wey dey pass","t":64.66,"e":67.08,"w":[["I",64.66,64.74],["wan",64.8,65.02],["be",65.08,65.18],["like",65.22,65.34],["shadow",65.4,65.72],["like",65.8,66.02],["breeze",66.08,66.38],["wey",66.42,66.52],["dey",66.56,66.66],["pass",66.74,67.08]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"No be every time I be the pillar or glass.","t":67.36,"e":69.76,"w":[["No",67.36,67.5],["be",67.54,67.66],["every",67.74,67.94],["time",68.02,68.18],["I",68.26,68.3],["be",68.34,68.44],["the",68.5,68.6],["pillar",68.66,69],["or",69.14,69.34],["glass",69.28,69.76]],"ok":0.9},{"text":"One minute for me, to no be their light","t":69.84,"e":72.2,"w":[["One",69.84,70.04],["minute",70.1,70.4],["for",70.44,70.56],["me",70.66,70.98],["to",71.12,71.36],["no",71.42,71.52],["be",71.56,71.68],["their",71.72,71.88],["light",71.94,72.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Make I fit know myself, before the day bright.","t":72.26,"e":74.98,"w":[["Make",72.26,72.4],["I",72.46,72.5],["fit",72.62,72.82],["know",72.74,72.86],["myself",72.92,73.5],["before",73.56,73.86],["the",73.9,74],["day",74.08,74.44],["bright",74.54,74.98]],"ok":0.89},{"text":"I just need to breathe, make I find small space","t":79.44,"e":91.18,"w":[["I",79.44,79.62],["just",89.36,89.6],["need",89.68,89.92],["to",89.98,90.1],["breathe",90.16,90.62],["make",90.68,90.96],["I",91.04,91.1],["find",91.18,91.18],["small",91.18,91.18],["space",91.18,91.18]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Place wey nobody go look my face...","t":91.18,"e":91.18,"w":[["Place",91.18,91.18],["wey",91.18,91.18],["nobody",91.18,91.18],["go",91.18,91.18],["look",91.18,91.18],["my",91.18,91.18],["face",91.18,91.18]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ce n'est pas que je les aime moins, non, c'est juste le bruit","t":96.34,"e":100.62,"w":[["Ce",96.34,96.44],["n'est",96.5,96.62],["pas",96.68,96.8],["que",96.82,96.94],["je",97,97.12],["les",97.18,97.36],["aime",97.4,97.62],["moins",97.68,97.94],["non",98.04,98.28],["c'est",98.46,98.6],["juste",98.68,98.94],["le",99,99.12],["bruit",100.42,100.62]],"ok":0.92},{"text":"Le bruit de leurs attentes qui dévore mes nuits.","t":101.72,"e":105.14,"w":[["Le",101.72,101.82],["bruit",101.96,102.16],["de",102.1,102.18],["leurs",102.24,102.4],["attentes",102.48,102.86],["qui",102.9,103.14],["dévore",103.26,104.22],["mes",104.3,104.42],["nuits",104.54,105.14]],"ok":0.89},{"text":"Il faut savoir se perdre pour mieux les retrouver","t":106.9,"e":111.32,"w":[["Il",106.9,107],["faut",107.08,107.26],["savoir",107.36,107.82],["se",107.9,108.02],["perdre",108.12,108.68],["pour",108.78,109],["mieux",109.08,109.36],["les",109.46,109.68],["retrouver",109.78,111.32]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"S'accorder le droit, parfois, de s'effacer.","t":112.14,"e":116.68,"w":[["S'accorder",112.14,112.8],["le",112.88,113.02],["droit",113.1,113.9],["parfois",114,114.6],["de",114.68,114.82],["s'effacer",114.94,116.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La porte est fermée.","t":119.72,"e":120.94,"w":[["La",119.72,119.82],["porte",119.92,120.22],["est",120.26,120.34],["fermée",120.44,120.94]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"The noise don stop.","t":125.22,"e":126.96,"w":[["The",125.22,125.32],["noise",125.4,126],["don",126.22,126.46],["stop",126.62,126.96]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"At last...","t":130.78,"e":131.66,"w":[["At",130.78,130.94],["last",131,131.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je respire.","t":135.6,"e":136.56,"w":[["Je",135.6,135.74],["respire",135.8,136.56]],"ok":1.0}]}